projection,
\deqn{P\left(\min_{y \in Y} \frac{SB_{s,y}}{SB_{MSY,s}} > Lim_s\right)}{P( min over y in Y of SB[s,y]/SBMSY[s] > Lim[s] )}
where \code{SB} is spawning biomass or spawning production according to
\code{Definition}.
